{"id":"223855cc3c440e48d43e5155a4e8f6bddc3b91df","url":"https://www.ithome.com/1/024/062.htm","title":"荣耀 700 系列手机新技术 11 月 13 日亮相，预约已开启","site_name":"Info Flow","source":"IT之家 (ITHome)","byline":"作者：潞源","excerpt":"荣耀 700 系列预热视频显示代言人预计为鞠婧祎，目前已在京东开启预约，该系列将包含三款机型多个存储版本，还将首发背屏硬件级功能，功能细节暂未公布。##数码资讯##","content_html":"<DIV class=\"page\" id=\"readability-page-1\"><div id=\"paragraph\">\r\n            \r\n            <p data-vmark=\"a2b5\"><a href=\"https://www.ithome.com/\" target=\"_blank\">IT之家</a> 11 月 9 日消息，荣耀今天宣布，<strong>荣耀 700 系列手机新技术将于 11 月 13 日亮相</strong>。从官方公布的预热视频来看，<strong>这款手机的代言人预计是鞠婧祎</strong>。</p><p data-vmark=\"d2b4\"><a href=\"https://weibo.com/3206603957/Rqygbglwt\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://img.ithome.com/newsuploadfiles/2026/11/c325564e-45d8-46a6-9992-3c9e72e04bc1.jpg\" title=\"荣耀 700 系列手机新技术 11 月 13 日亮相，预约已开启\" data-original=\"https://img.ithome.com/newsuploadfiles/2026/11/c325564e-45d8-46a6-9992-3c9e72e04bc1.jpg\"></a></p><p data-vmark=\"3e22\">IT之家了解到，荣耀 700 系列手机已经在京东开启预约。</p><p data-vmark=\"5d8c\"><img src=\"https://img.ithome.com/newsuploadfiles/2026/11/fffad439-72aa-44dc-b9c6-656de6536420.jpg\" w=\"1247\" h=\"1000\" data-mpos=\"0,2\" data-vmark=\"ef5d\" title=\"荣耀 700 系列手机新技术 11 月 13 日亮相，预约已开启\" srcset=\"https://img.ithome.com/newsuploadfiles/2026/11/fffad439-72aa-44dc-b9c6-656de6536420.jpg 2x\" data-original=\"https://img.ithome.com/newsuploadfiles/2026/11/fffad439-72aa-44dc-b9c6-656de6536420.jpg\" width=\"1247\" height=\"658\"></p><dir><a contenteditable=\"false\" href=\"https://u.jd.com/o1t0qe9\" target=\"_blank\" data-wapurl=\"https://u.jd.com/oDt0bcA\" data-iosurl=\"https://u.jd.com/ortPEtK\" data-androidurl=\"https://u.jd.com/oGtPh2c\" data-hosnexturl=\"https://u.jd.com/o6tYHJ6\" data-hosurl=\"https://u.jd.com/oDtAkZ2\" data-uwpurl=\"https://u.jd.com/o6tE3XX\" data-wxmpurl=\"ithome://openmp?appid=wx91d27dbf599dff74&path=%2fpages%2funion%2fproxy%2fproxy%3fspreadUrl%3dhttps%253a%252f%252fu.jd.com%252fogtSKyk%26EA_PTAG%3d17078.27.38